    "title": "机制·效果",
    "category": 4,
    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·思维负荷和思绪</strong></span></span><br/></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"b4f3565ddc385302c4888fb9e8e61c59\" alt=\"3-2-1背包和碎片.png\" title=\"3-2-1背包和碎片.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/b4f3565ddc385302c4888fb9e8e61c59.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在本次集成战略</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【萨卡兹的无终奇语】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">主题中，在探险中会获得</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以用在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">去伪存真</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点中获取奖励。</span></span></p><p><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">思绪共存在三类种不同的类型：</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">遗愿</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">、</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">构想</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">和</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">灵感</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">遗愿</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">去伪存真</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">节点提升获得收藏品的概率，且当解读对象为两缕遗愿时可以获得更多选项。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">构想</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以在探险中用来打开纵向通路或刷新节点。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">灵感</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以在探险中使用并获得临时增益。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">共存在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">和</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">稀有度</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">两种属性，</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">会影响思维负荷，而</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">稀有度</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">会影响</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">去伪存真</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">奖励的品质。</span></span><br/><br/><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思维负荷</span></span><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在本次集成战略</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【萨卡兹的无终奇语】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">主题中，<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>会获得一个初始的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷临界点</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷临界点</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">会决定<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>携带的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的数量，<span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\">在探险中</span><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">可以使用至多三位助力干员来提高</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷临界点</span></span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当思维负荷超过</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷临界点</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">时将会负担，给探险带来危险。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">当思维负荷超过</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷阻滞点</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">时，<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>将会失去继续前行的能力，需要丢弃或使用</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">直到低于</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">负荷阻滞点</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">才可继续行动。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·</strong>去伪存真</span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"aa02b220414d03f007e9384a2da24b14\" alt=\"3-2-2去伪存真.png\" title=\"3-2-2去伪存真.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/aa02b220414d03f007e9384a2da24b14.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">解读的结果将会为<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>的探险提供增益。<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>使用的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">稀有度</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">越高，解读的结果也会越有利。</span></span></p><p><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在解读过程中，<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>所使用的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">类型将会影响解读的结果，<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>可在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">解读预测</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中查看具体影响。</span></span></p><p><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">部分</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">组合可以获得特定的解读结果，在使用特定的</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">组合后，将会出现走向不同结局的道路。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·印象重建</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"ee1e4aaf9f02816df2d6591dce6d1865\" alt=\"3-2-3印象重建.png\" title=\"3-2-3印象重建.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/ee1e4aaf9f02816df2d6591dce6d1865.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在本次集成战略</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【萨卡兹的无终奇语】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">主题中，去伪存真，商店和安全的角落可以消耗构想进行印象<span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\">固化</span></span>。固化后在本次集成战略主题中可以获得永久生效的奖励。</span></span><br/><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">除此之外，在每次对局开始时，三个节点都会在三种效果中随机选择一种作为印象加深的效果。<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>可在印象完全固化后在对应节点消耗构想进行印象加深，并在本场对局中享受此加成。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\">·年代</span></span></strong></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"78e7aae863826446628f71deda02974a\" alt=\"3-2-4年代.png\" title=\"3-2-4年代.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/78e7aae863826446628f71deda02974a.png\"/></div><p><br/><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在探险途中，<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>会进入各种不同的年代。这些年代会给<span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span>的探险增加特殊的变化。同时仅会存在一个年代。年代会在持续一定节点之后消散。</span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·拾取回忆</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"d1c7764899bd8514c78e7cb9e34407f4\" alt=\"3-2-5拾取回忆.png\" title=\"3-2-5拾取回忆.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/d1c7764899bd8514c78e7cb9e34407f4.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">失败的<span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span>成为了历史洪流的一部分，再一次走上这条路的人偶尔会在路上发现自己留下的回忆。</span><br/><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在<span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"line-height:1\">您</span></span>在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;常规行动&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">倒在</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【或然歧域】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">或更深层时，下一次</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">&lt;常规行动&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中到达</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">【或然歧域】</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">或更深时有概率在战斗后获得部分</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">思绪</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></p>",
    "displayTime": "2024-07-16",
    "sticky": false,
    "updatedAt": 1721288879
  }
}